{"src":"zh","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":170300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"zh","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":14694.869719999999,"text":"如果你看过电影《国家宝藏》,你可能会以为《独立宣言》背面会画着一份藏宝图。"},{"kind":"text","t":15759.159493,"text":"If you've seen the movie National Treasure, you might think there's a treasure map drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":15883.65409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15889.307729,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":15894.836459000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":460,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15900.509337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15906.359932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15912.006090000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":15912.958444,"samples":9792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17224.440632,"text":"这巧克力达到了比利时的标准 果汁价格昂贵 但品质很好"},{"kind":"text","t":17954.948076,"text":"This chocolate meets Belgian standards; the juice is expensive, but the quality is very good."},{"kind":"audio","t":18065.100167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":18070.634387000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":18071.231987,"samples":9464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":18160.073564000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18161.364253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18162.924158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":18163.178864,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":26409.273782,"text":"然而事实并非如此,虽然这份文件的背面写了一些东西,但并不是一份藏宝图。"},{"kind":"text","t":27432.56085,"text":"However, that is not the case; although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":27543.38402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27547.259217000003,"samples":28432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"audio","t":27635.201389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27640.372255000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27645.667109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27651.258358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":27651.590843,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":36476.396889999996,"text":"你也可以咨询除贵国以外其他政府的建议 但他们的建议是为他们的公民而制定的"},{"kind":"text","t":37351.657892999996,"text":"You may also seek advice from governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their own citizens."},{"kind":"audio","t":37472.965523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37478.306156,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37483.412422999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":37488.889753999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37494.391485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37498.639925999996,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":43785.702735,"text":"香港岛是香港地区的代名词 也是众多游客心目中的焦点所在"},{"kind":"text","t":44551.433916999995,"text":"Hong Kong Island is synonymous with the Hong Kong region and is the focal point for many tourists."},{"kind":"audio","t":44671.242821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44676.613713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44681.73041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":44687.051144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":44692.771441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":44693.108705,"samples":5360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52229.783446999994,"text":"任何在高纬度地区开车或翻越山口的人都应该考虑到可能遭遇下雪、结冰或冻结温度的情况。"},{"kind":"text","t":53209.146229,"text":"Anyone driving in high-latitude regions or crossing mountain passes should consider the possibility of encountering snow, ice, or freezing temperatures."},{"kind":"audio","t":53334.835376999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53337.902977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53341.205094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53344.408582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53347.826945999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53351.174982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":53354.937631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53358.507243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":53358.845776999995,"samples":3056,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":58659.629865999996,"text":"由于分离和重组,变异在每一代的两个库之间来回变动"},{"kind":"text","t":59429.360123,"text":"Due to segregation and recombination, variations fluctuate back and forth between the two libraries in each generation."},{"kind":"audio","t":59547.010382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59552.11702899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":59557.368524,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":59562.787956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59568.138248999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59573.490922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":59573.974504,"samples":9792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":65258.495520000004,"text":"昆虫学家们用虫字一词来正式称呼这一类的昆虫"},{"kind":"text","t":66027.114745,"text":"Entomologists use the term \"chong\" to formally refer to this class of insects."},{"kind":"audio","t":66143.111231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66148.18543900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":66153.422044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66158.897505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":66159.619263,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":76081.590369,"text":"首先大多数骑马人会穿戴跟马靴"},{"kind":"text","t":76461.23969300001,"text":"First, most riders wear riding boots."},{"kind":"audio","t":76564.85948900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76570.10014400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":76570.47354800001,"samples":9464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":80470.618208,"text":"而且鞋底光滑 及相当狭窄"},{"kind":"text","t":80899.83109600001,"text":"Moreover, the soles are smooth and quite narrow."},{"kind":"audio","t":81008.884155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81014.168009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81016.76659700001,"samples":21464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":89269.161422,"text":"该委员会是马尔泰利对事于10月份的大规模反正武抗活动做出的回应。"},{"kind":"text","t":90166.59242500001,"text":"The committee was a response by Martelli to the large-scale armed counter-insurgency activities in October."},{"kind":"audio","t":90285.13626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90286.551557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":90287.861036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":90289.55405800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90291.31483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90291.789542,"samples":17360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":95340.665682,"text":"消防救援人員最終在晚上11點35分撲滅了大火"},{"kind":"text","t":96031.79313600001,"text":"Firefighters finally extinguished the fire at 11:35 p.m."},{"kind":"audio","t":96140.809186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96141.864188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96143.52373100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96145.076446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":96145.20872400001,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":104579.88088900001,"text":"亚热带风暴节锐今天在大西洋形成 这是大西洋预风季节中第十个被命名的风暴"},{"kind":"text","t":105454.208027,"text":"Subtropical Storm Leslie formed in the Atlantic today; it is the tenth named storm of the Atlantic hurricane season."},{"kind":"audio","t":105567.010955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105572.136942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105577.647692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":105578.01378600001,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":105665.492125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105669.052627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105674.197434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":105674.492209,"samples":9096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":111229.56864700001,"text":"有了它,我们才有了火车、汽车和许多其他交通工具。"},{"kind":"text","t":111923.620654,"text":"Because of it, we have trains, cars, and many other means of transportation."},{"kind":"audio","t":112036.718817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112042.106379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112047.42340300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112053.077061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":112053.418565,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118736.544741,"text":"它作为奢侈品中心的生育始于公元400年左右,一直持续到公元1100年左右。"},{"kind":"text","t":119716.053851,"text":"Its growth as a center of luxury began around 400 AD and continued until around 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":119838.5956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119843.54162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":119848.861053,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119853.92384100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119859.051508,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119864.380931,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119868.13239,"samples":25992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":125325.28021900001,"text":"月球的表面由岩石和灰尘组成 月球的外层叫做"},{"kind":"text","t":126096.070829,"text":"The surface of the moon consists of rock and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called"},{"kind":"audio","t":126207.004157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126212.183613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126215.740726,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"audio","t":126289.103184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126293.91857600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":126294.25487,"samples":1064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":136039.00860499998,"text":"美国陆军工兵部队估计,6英寸的降雨量就可能冲垮之前损坏的堤坝。"},{"kind":"text","t":136983.829298,"text":"The U.S. Army Corps of Engineers estimates that 6 inches of rain could breach the previously damaged levee."},{"kind":"audio","t":137105.63126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137110.91656399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":137116.11907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137121.373634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137126.673648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137131.669157,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":143451.47659399998,"text":"具体来说,据说可以通过正确解读微表情来判断一个人是否在撒谎。"},{"kind":"text","t":144256.698255,"text":"Specifically, it is said that one can determine whether a person is lying by correctly interpreting microexpressions."},{"kind":"audio","t":144378.92137899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":144384.130335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144389.536217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144394.78355199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":144400.111025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144404.71466,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":151454.66481699998,"text":"切勿在建筑物上做标记或涂鸦以免破坏遗址"},{"kind":"text","t":152080.70027899998,"text":"Do not make marks or graffiti on the buildings to avoid damaging the site."},{"kind":"audio","t":152195.1198,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":152200.546092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152205.552661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152210.435081,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":162304.907946,"text":"老虎的咆哮不像狮子的咆哮那样深沉 而更像一句生气似吼的话语"},{"kind":"text","t":163279.424837,"text":"A tiger's roar is not as deep as a lion's, but sounds more like an angry, shouting word."},{"kind":"audio","t":163398.11231899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163403.23752599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":163408.621358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163413.846353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,